    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Megumi brings Akiko home to the Sahara house, where Megumi's mother Kayo greets them in the entryway with immaculate manners. Kayo warmly offers delicious cake, yet before Akiko can take another step inside, Kayo insists she go straight to the washroom to wash her feet. Listen to the classic Japanese doorway greetings first, and notice the quiet tension underneath Kayo's gentle voice.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "ただいま。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "おかえりなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "恵美さん、ちゃんとお祈りはしてきた？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "いつも教会につきあってくれてありがとう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "いえ、そんな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "おいしいケーキがありますから、上がっていってください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "お邪魔します。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "足、洗わないとね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "恵美さん、お風呂場に行っていただいて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "いつもこうなの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "何が？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "何でもない。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stepping into a Japanese home comes with its own set of set-piece greetings—plus Kayo's unusually strict twist. Let's walk through each key moment.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "ただいま。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "おかえりなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Welcome home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "恵美さん、ちゃんとお祈りはしてきた？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Megumi, did you say your prayers properly?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "いつも教会につきあってくれてありがとう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for always going to church with her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "いえ、そんな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, not at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "おいしいケーキがありますから、上がっていってください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have delicious cake, so please come on in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "お邪魔します。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pardon the intrusion.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "足、洗わないとね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You must wash your feet first, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "恵美さん、お風呂場に行っていただいて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Megumi, please show her to the washroom.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "いつもこうなの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is it always like this?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "何でもない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
